# BEGIN claude-managed (header-note)
# eval-scheduler, candidate-scheduler, memory-decay-scheduler migrated to launchd
# 2026-08-07 (~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.claude.{eval,candidate,memory-decay}-scheduler.plist)
# -- plain cron silently skips a run if the machine is asleep at 08:00 (observed:
# 2026-07-31, 2026-08-04 both missed); launchd's StartCalendarInterval coalesces
# missed events on wake, same mechanism the per-project memory-maintenance jobs
# already use. build-cache-scheduler stays here: no missed-run gap observed for it.
# END claude-managed (header-note)
# BEGIN claude-managed (build-cache-scheduler)
0 9 * * 1 $HOME/.claude/scripts/build-cache-scheduler.sh >> $HOME/.claude/agent-memory/build-cache-checks/cron.log 2>&1
# END claude-managed (build-cache-scheduler)
# BEGIN claude-managed (clean-old-chat-history)
0 8 1 * * $HOME/.claude/scripts/clean-old-chat-history.sh --force >> $HOME/.claude/agent-memory/chat-cleanup.log 2>&1
# END claude-managed (clean-old-chat-history)
# BEGIN claude-managed (clean-merged-worktrees)
0 8 1 * * $HOME/.claude/scripts/clean-merged-worktrees.sh --force >> $HOME/.claude/agent-memory/worktree-cleanup.log 2>&1
# END claude-managed (clean-merged-worktrees)
